
This directory is for PlatformIO tests and standalone test firmware.

## Tests

| Folder | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| `test_xy_motors` | X/Y/Z ping-pong: +100 / -100 steps continuously |
| `test_endstop` | Endstop state monitor on serial |
| `test_movement` | Manual X/Y/Z jog via serial (single or combined) |
| `test_home` | Seek / backoff / reapproach homing per axis |
| `test_zero_motors` | Home X/Y, zero positions, manual jog with X/Y totals |

More information: https://docs.platformio.org/en/latest/advanced/unit-testing/index.html
